\item[S2] Henry Cohn and Noam Elkies, \emph{New upper bounds on sphere packings I}, Annals of Mathematics 157 (2003), 689--714; arXiv:math/0110009v3, Section 1 and Appendix A. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/0110009}.
